("note", "FORMULA", "**Molecular mass** (covalent compounds) = sum of atomic masses of all atoms in the molecule, in **u**. **Formula unit mass** (ionic compounds) = sum of atomic masses in one formula unit (simplest ratio of ions; ionic compounds form no molecules)."),
